#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:5 c1a0c145b5f447d8a4a2b2dda2ebf35b
msgid "Radio Failsafe"
msgstr "无线电失控保护"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:7 db3b27d4da3f46c69d7d197c3aa52841
msgid ""
"Copter supports several configurable failsafe options in cases where contact"
" between the Pilot's RC transmitter and the autopilot's receiver is lost.  "
"This page explains this failsafe's setup and testing.  Note the \"Radio "
"failsafe\" was previously called \"Throttle failsafe\" because of the way in"
" which some receivers use the throttle channel to signal the loss of "
"contact."
msgstr ""
"在飞手RC遥控器与飞控接收机失去联系的情况下，Copter支持多种可配置的失控保护选项。本页面介绍该失控保护的设置和测试方法。注意，\"无线电失控保护\"之前称为\"油门失控保护\"，原因是部分接收机通过油门通道来发出失联信号。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:11 ca87532d48cb4303a62bfac97936bfb8
msgid ""
"For Single Helicopter, Dual Helicopter and Quad Helicopter frames, Copter "
"3.6 and earlier in any :ref:`H_RSC Mode<H_RSC_MODE>` or Copter 4.0 in the RC"
" Passthrough :ref:`H_RSC_Mode<H_RSC_MODE>` requires the RC receiver channel "
"8 to hold last value when transmitter signal is lost.  If the receiver sends"
" no signal or does not hold the RC channel 8 value, the motor will be "
"shutdown and the helicopter will crash."
msgstr ""
"对于单直升机、双旋翼直升机和四旋翼直升机机架，Copter 3.6及更早版本的任意 :ref:`H_RSC Mode<H_RSC_MODE>` "
"或Copter 4.0的RC直通 :ref:`H_RSC_Mode<H_RSC_MODE>` "
"模式要求，当遥控信号丢失时，接收机通道8保持最后值。如果接收机不发送信号或不保持RC通道8的值，电机将被关闭，直升机将坠毁。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:18 0cd172e5d2844450b66aeb8d1520b53d
msgid ""
"Copter also supports other failsafes, including: :ref:`Battery <failsafe-"
"battery>`, :ref:`Ground Station <gcs-failsafe>` and :ref:`EKF/DCM failsafes "
"<ekf-inav-failsafe>`. See the :ref:`failsafe-landing-page` for more details."
msgstr ""
"Copter还支持其他失控保护，包括：:ref:`Battery <failsafe-battery>`、:ref:`Ground Station "
"<gcs-failsafe>` 和 :ref:`EKF/DCM failsafes <ekf-inav-failsafe>`。详情请参阅 "
":ref:`failsafe-landing-page`。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:21 70fac403eff34f6e93ed3212c00c79ea
msgid "When the failsafe will trigger"
msgstr "失控保护的触发时机"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:23 abe12ea7167542dab4fea3b8572c70e6
msgid ""
"If enabled and set-up correctly the radio failsafe will trigger if any of "
"these conditions occur for more than :ref:`RC_FS_TIMEOUT<RC_FS_TIMEOUT>` "
"seconds:"
msgstr ""
"如果已启用并正确设置，当以下任一条件持续超过 :ref:`RC_FS_TIMEOUT<RC_FS_TIMEOUT>` 秒时，无线电失控保护将触发："

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:25 659cc797dc3a4dcb88161f427c87d46e
msgid "The pilot turns off the RC transmitter."
msgstr "飞手关闭RC遥控器。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:26 4440a8e01bb74a4baf0a619f8eb7f7cc
msgid "The vehicle travels outside of RC range and signal is lost."
msgstr "飞行器飞出RC信号范围导致信号丢失。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:27 99b294959fb24be7bdb2b839c4ca2bf2
msgid ""
"The pilot forces the throttle channel below "
":ref:`FS_THR_VALUE<FS_THR_VALUE>` from the transmitter."
msgstr "飞手在遥控器上将油门通道强制拉低至 :ref:`FS_THR_VALUE<FS_THR_VALUE>` 以下。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:28 1267b456cbe9480aba800b44a9d3c5d8
msgid ""
"RC_OVERRIDES are lost if :ref:`using a GCS only <common-gcs-only-operation>`"
" is being used."
msgstr "如果 :ref:`仅使用地面站 <common-gcs-only-operation>`，RC_OVERRIDES丢失。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:29 2ff337d51f1e45b58f3a948e2835e086
msgid "The receiver loses power (unlikely)."
msgstr "接收机断电（概率极低）。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:30 02d485e12a164437bc58b407b8ffc445
msgid ""
"The wires connecting the receiver to the autopilot are broken (unlikely)."
msgstr "接收机与飞控之间的连接线断裂（概率极低）。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:34 eafedc74a6e44c2fb7c3f1d2b225794a
msgid "What will happen"
msgstr "将会发生什么"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:36 a5407093e6094c38bb43b9d3833228dc
msgid ""
"When a radio failsafe is triggered, the copter can be configured via "
"parameters to do nothing, land immediately, RTL, or SmartRTL.  It can also "
"be configured to bypass the failsafe in an Auto Mode mission, or to continue"
" landing if already in a landing phase."
msgstr ""
"当无线电失控保护触发时，飞行器可通过参数配置为：不执行任何操作、立即降落、执行RTL或SmartRTL。也可以配置为在Auto模式任务中绕过失控保护，或在已处于降落阶段时继续降落。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:38 1a6fb89ebaee4f74b571ba50d556aeab
msgid "If the copter is disarmed, no failsafe will take place."
msgstr "如果飞行器已上锁，不会触发任何失控保护。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:39 c55240f38c8a4662a8abab87db23c8c5
msgid ""
"If the copter is armed but has landed, the copter will immediately disarm."
msgstr "如果飞行器已解锁但已降落，飞行器将立即上锁。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:40 4882eda0d72a4054a29f72a19c8c3e4c
msgid ""
"If the copter is armed in Stabilize or Acro modes, and the throttle input is"
" at minimum, the copter will immediately disarm."
msgstr "如果飞行器在Stabilize或Acro模式下已解锁，且油门输入为最小值，飞行器将立即上锁。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:41 31abb7ec105845c6906ae3a31a42483c
msgid ""
"Otherwise, the copter will take the actions as configured in the parameters "
"described below."
msgstr "否则，飞行器将按以下参数配置执行相应操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:43 ec69c8efc1cb436a9c9abbd30c5600fe
msgid ""
"If the failsafe clears (i.e. transmitter and receiver regain contact) the "
"copter will remain in its failsafe mode. It will **not** automatically "
"return to the flight mode that was active before the failsafe was triggered."
" This means that if, for example, the vehicle was in Loiter when the "
"failsafe occurred and the flight mode was automatically changed to RTL, even"
" after the transmitter and receiver regained contact, the vehicle would "
"remain in RTL.  If the pilot wished to re-take control in Loiter he/she "
"would need to change your flight mode switch to another position and then "
"back to Loiter."
msgstr ""
"如果失控保护解除（即遥控器与接收机恢复联系），飞行器将保持在其失控保护模式。它**不会**自动返回失控保护触发前的飞行模式。这意味着，例如，如果飞行器在Loiter模式下发生失控保护并自动切换到RTL模式，即使遥控器与接收机恢复联系，飞行器仍将保持在RTL模式。如果飞手希望重新在Loiter模式下取得控制权，需要将飞行模式开关拨到其他位置，然后再拨回Loiter。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:46 bae45af091834733a2ec1dd8aa513e41
msgid "Receiver Configuration"
msgstr "接收机配置"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:48 4fffa6e483bb45489465e9a606556857
msgid ""
"By default, most newly purchased receivers will simply not output pulses if "
"contact with the transmitter is lost. However, some low end receivers will "
"be set-up to simply hold all channels at their last known position.  This is"
" not good because the autopilot has no way to know that the Pilot has lost "
"control of the vehicle.  Instead the receiver must be set-up to signal to "
"the autopilot it has lost contact and there are two ways that it can do this"
" (the method depends upon the receiver). Each brand of Transmitter/Receiver "
"is slightly different so please refer to your transmitter's user manual to "
"determine which method is available and how to set it up."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，大多数新购接收机在与遥控器失去联系时将停止输出脉冲信号。但部分低端接收机会被设置为保持所有通道的最后已知位置。这样做不好，因为飞控无法得知飞手已失去对飞行器的控制。因此，接收机必须设置为向飞控发出失联信号，共有两种方式（取决于接收机型号）。每个品牌的遥控器/接收机设置略有不同，请参阅您的遥控器用户手册以确定可用方式及设置方法。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:51 a0a9de305aea4d0e91e1e048438b4b93
msgid "Receiver configuration for low-throttle method"
msgstr "低油门方式的接收机配置"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:52 49c9227d18754954a57cda27dec8dccb
msgid ""
"The **\"Low-Throttle\" method** pulls the throttle channel (normally channel"
" 3) to a value below the bottom of its normal range (normally below 1000us)."
"  This method is used by Futaba systems and many older systems.  Below is "
"the setup method for a Futaba T7C Transmitter with R617FS or TFR4-B receiver"
" which uses the \"low throttle\" method."
msgstr ""
"**\"低油门\"方式**将油门通道（通常为通道3）拉低至其正常范围以下（通常低于1000us）。此方式由Futaba系统及许多老款系统使用。以下是使用\"低油门\"方式的Futaba"
" T7C遥控器配合R617FS或TFR4-B接收机的设置方法。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:58 719c66da09c344489cc40a051ffa4ed1
msgid ""
"Many receivers allow for the failsafe positions to be set either by simply "
"pressing a button on the receiver, or directly from the transmitter. In this"
" case, the transmitter is temporarily adjusted to output a throttle signal "
"below the normal low idle position (if low idle is 1000us, then 990uS would "
"be sent) setting this as the failsafe value for the receiver, then adjusting"
" low stick back to normal idle position. This below throttle idle value is "
"then set for :ref:`FS_THR_VALUE<FS_THR_VALUE>`, as discussed below."
msgstr ""
"许多接收机允许通过直接按接收机上的按钮或直接从遥控器设置失控保护位置。在这种情况下，遥控器临时调整输出低于正常怠速位置的油门信号（若低怠速为1000us，则发送990us）作为接收机的失控保护值，然后将低摇杆调回正常怠速位置。此低于油门怠速的值随后作为"
" :ref:`FS_THR_VALUE<FS_THR_VALUE>` 进行设置，如下所述。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:61 487a3b1231ee4e32b04df645647861ad
msgid "Receiver configuration for No-Signal method"
msgstr "无信号方式的接收机配置"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:62 598b978d43be43dfb5c8f28f97426955
msgid ""
"**\"No Signal\" method** - the receiver stops sending signals to the "
"autopilot.  This is the preferred method and is how most modern FrSky "
"receivers operate. Below is the setup method for a FlySky 9 channel "
"transmitter with FrSky D4R-II receiver which uses the \"No Signal\" method."
msgstr ""
"**\"无信号\"方式** - "
"接收机停止向飞控发送信号。这是首选方式，也是大多数现代FrSky接收机的工作方式。以下是使用\"无信号\"方式的FlySky 9通道遥控器配合FrSky"
" D4R-II接收机的设置方法。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:69 f108226b45e24d32ad99f63f663bbc34
msgid "Parameter Configuration"
msgstr "参数配置"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:71 13b7df08853d442488e4b0d159a2a951
msgid ""
"The :ref:`FS_THR_ENABLE<FS_THR_ENABLE>` parameter can be set in the Mission "
"Planner full parameter list or full parameter tree, or can also be set using"
" the Mission Planner *failsafe options* dropdown in the Initial Setup >> "
"Mandatory Hardware >> Failsafe menu."
msgstr ""
":ref:`FS_THR_ENABLE<FS_THR_ENABLE>` 参数可在 Mission Planner "
"的完整参数列表或完整参数树中设置，也可以通过 Mission Planner 的Initial Setup >> Mandatory Hardware "
">> Failsafe菜单中的*失控保护选项*下拉菜单进行设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:73 de65377429d6457ebd61a1a62ed51859
msgid "**Disabled** (Value 0) will disable the radio failsafe entirely."
msgstr "**禁用**（值0）将完全禁用无线电失控保护。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:74 7c954877d8004e09b62fccdd83f0d007
msgid ""
"**Enabled Always RTL** (Value 1) will switch the copter to RTL Mode.  If the"
" GPS position is not usable, the copter will change to Land Mode instead."
msgstr "**始终RTL**（值1）将把飞行器切换到RTL模式。如果GPS位置不可用，飞行器将改为切换到Land模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:75 d69a17f094624f4fa0c4f35a6c600f1a
msgid ""
"**Enabled Continue with Mission in Auto Mode** (this value has no effect in "
"4.0 and later with :ref:`FS_OPTIONS<FS_OPTIONS>` parameter replacing "
"function, see below) (Value 2) will ignore the failsafe in an Auto Mode "
"mission. Otherwise, it will behave the same as *Enabled Always RTL*. This "
"option no longer exists in ArduCopter 4.0. Instead, see the "
":ref:`FS_OPTIONS<FS_OPTIONS>` parameter for this function. Setting this "
"value in Copter 4.0 and later version will automatically be converted and "
"set to (Value 1) and the :ref:`FS_OPTIONS<FS_OPTIONS>` will be modified to "
"include bit (0) in the bitmask for \"Continue if in auto mode on Radio "
"Failsafe\"."
msgstr ""
"**在Auto模式任务中继续执行**（此值在4.0及更高版本中无效，:ref:`FS_OPTIONS<FS_OPTIONS>` "
"参数已替代此功能，见下文）（值2）将在Auto模式任务中忽略失控保护。否则，其行为与*始终RTL*相同。此选项在ArduCopter "
"4.0中已不存在，请改用 :ref:`FS_OPTIONS<FS_OPTIONS>` 参数实现此功能。在Copter "
"4.0及更高版本中设置此值将自动转换并设置为（值1），同时 :ref:`FS_OPTIONS<FS_OPTIONS>` "
"将被修改以在位掩码中包含位（0），用于\"在Auto模式下无线电失控保护时继续执行\"。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:76 37d8a08d0fbc45d29adff033f3103a18
msgid "**Enabled Always Land** (Value 3) will switch the copter to Land Mode."
msgstr "**始终降落**（值3）将把飞行器切换到Land模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:77 db6bfa0858814c7c8dcda2aa39a2617d
msgid ""
"**Enabled SmartRTL or RTL** (Value 4) will switch the copter to SmartRTL "
"mode. If SmartRTL is not available, the copter will switch to RTL Mode "
"instead.  If the GPS position is not usable, the copter will change to Land "
"Mode instead."
msgstr ""
"**SmartRTL或RTL**（值4）将把飞行器切换到SmartRTL模式。如果SmartRTL不可用，飞行器将改为切换到RTL模式。如果GPS位置不可用，飞行器将改为切换到Land模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:78 bf1264cd92c341869a183a1cc5425e7c
msgid ""
"**Enabled SmartRTL or Land** (Value 5) will switch the copter to SmartRTL "
"mode. If SmartRTL is not available, the copter will switch to Land Mode "
"instead."
msgstr "**SmartRTL或降落**（值5）将把飞行器切换到SmartRTL模式。如果SmartRTL不可用，飞行器将改为切换到Land模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:79 80e66a3b3bd54daeaa0123a37d97bc81
msgid ""
"**Enabled Auto DO_LAND_START or RTL** (value 6) will jump to the nearest "
"\"DO_LAND_START\" mission item or RTL if no \"DO_LAND_START\" mission item "
"has been programmed(see :ref:`common-do-land-start`)."
msgstr ""
"**Auto "
"DO_LAND_START或RTL**（值6）将跳转到最近的\"DO_LAND_START\"任务项，如果没有已编程的\"DO_LAND_START\"任务项，则执行RTL（参见"
" :ref:`common-do-land-start`）。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:80 8986a66838c74ff7a3579def850fd9a9
msgid ""
"**Enabled always Brake or Land** will BRAKE or LAND if GPS position is not "
"available."
msgstr "**始终Brake或降落**：如果GPS位置不可用，将执行Brake或降落操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:81 0fab4b0eca7c43eaaaa788e7ce990f0e
msgid ""
"Any invaild value (Such as accidentally enter 99 as a parameter value) will "
"will behave the same as **Enabled Always LAND**"
msgstr "任何无效值（例如不小心将参数值设为99）的行为与**始终降落**相同。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:83 672aeac8f71b49698ebf99c629b8f23d
msgid ""
"The :ref:`FS_THR_VALUE<FS_THR_VALUE>`  parameter can be set in the Mission "
"Planner full parameter list or full parameter tree, or can also be set using"
" the Mission Planner *FS PWM* value in the Initial Setup >> Mandatory "
"Hardware >> Failsafe menu. -  At least 10 PWM higher than your Channel 3's "
"PWM value when the throttle stick is fully down and the transmitter is "
"**off** -  At least 10 PWM lower than your channel 3's PWM value when the "
"throttle stick is fully down and the transmitter is **on** -  Above 910 PWM"
msgstr ""
":ref:`FS_THR_VALUE<FS_THR_VALUE>` 参数可在 Mission Planner "
"的完整参数列表或完整参数树中设置，也可以通过 Mission Planner 的Initial Setup >> Mandatory Hardware "
">> Failsafe菜单中的*FS PWM*值进行设置。- 至少比遥控器**关闭**时油门摇杆完全拉低时通道3的PWM值高10 - "
"至少比遥控器**打开**时油门摇杆完全拉低时通道3的PWM值低10 - 高于910 PWM"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:88 208614bc6d0c460c82c1a850dc0bc17b
msgid ""
"The :ref:`FS_OPTIONS<FS_OPTIONS>`  parameter (Copter 4.0 and later) is a "
"bitmask parameter to select one or more options that modify the standard "
"actions of the radio, GCS, and battery failsafe. In the Mission Planner full"
" parameter list or full parameter tree, the handy checkbox popup window is "
"an easy what to set this (and any other bitmask) parameter. Be sure to go to"
" Help > Check Beta Updates to pull the latest parameter definitions first "
"while connected to the internet. The :ref:`FS_OPTIONS<FS_OPTIONS>` bits are "
"as follows:"
msgstr ""
":ref:`FS_OPTIONS<FS_OPTIONS>` 参数（Copter "
"4.0及更高版本）是一个位掩码参数，用于选择一个或多个选项，以修改无线电、地面站和电池失控保护的标准动作。在 Mission Planner "
"的完整参数列表或完整参数树中，方便的复选框弹窗是设置此参数（及任何其他位掩码参数）的简便方式。在联网状态下，请先前往Help > Check Beta "
"Updates获取最新参数定义。:ref:`FS_OPTIONS<FS_OPTIONS>` 各位含义如下："

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:90 c36cb3c3550c48cfb3afd7a082f08e85
msgid ""
"bit 0 set: Continue if in auto mode on :ref:`Radio Failsafe <radio-"
"failsafe>`"
msgstr "第0位置1：:ref:`Radio Failsafe <radio-failsafe>` 期间若在Auto模式则继续执行"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:91 34d3a7033e4d41c5b12e2a001388d025
msgid ""
"bit 1 set: Continue if in auto mode on :ref:`Ground Control Station "
"Failsafe<gcs-failsafe>`"
msgstr ""
"第1位置1：:ref:`Ground Control Station Failsafe<gcs-failsafe>` 期间若在Auto模式则继续执行"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:92 f20fdd76aba44c6fa3116df8069dd66b
msgid ""
"bit 2 set: Continue if in guided mode :ref:`Radio Failsafe <radio-failsafe>`"
msgstr "第2位置1：:ref:`Radio Failsafe <radio-failsafe>` 期间若在Guided模式则继续执行"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:93 a968fcf6a6c84cb095ab3f33ccfeeb29
msgid "bit 3 set: Continue if landing on any failsafe"
msgstr "第3位置1：任何失控保护期间若正在降落则继续降落"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:94 0c977a62a5c1403c8a504e7787a294aa
msgid ""
"bit 4 set: Continue in pilot control on :ref:`Ground Control Station "
"Failsafe<gcs-failsafe>`"
msgstr "第4位置1：:ref:`Ground Control Station Failsafe<gcs-failsafe>` 期间由飞手继续控制"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:95 db5690851b3c4c1088a480707c53334a
msgid ""
"if none of the above are set, then execute the "
":ref:`FS_THR_ENABLE<FS_THR_ENABLE>` option as configured."
msgstr "如果以上均未置位，则按配置的 :ref:`FS_THR_ENABLE<FS_THR_ENABLE>` 选项执行。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:97 12817768c10f4681bfd69dcbee6b42b6
msgid ""
"Only bitmask bits 0, 2, & 3 affect actions taken during radio failsafe. This"
" parameter also works in conjunction with the battery and GCS failsafe, so "
"ensure you are taking all options into account when setting this parameter."
msgstr "仅位掩码第0、2和3位影响无线电失控保护期间采取的动作。此参数还与电池和地面站失控保护联动，设置时请综合考虑所有选项。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:99 2daa7a47a5074131a56d0529cb7b2950
msgid ""
"Below is a screenshot of the Mission Planner Initial Setup >> Mandatory "
"Hardware >> Failsafe menu."
msgstr ""
"以下是 Mission Planner Initial Setup >> Mandatory Hardware >> Failsafe菜单的截图。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:105 987d9225ecb34acdbde6011d0bbf4a23
msgid "Testing"
msgstr "测试"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:107 02d931559c3b481fb479a46825690830
msgid ""
"You can check your failsafe by performing the following tests with the "
"autopilot connected to the Mission Planner either via a USB cable or "
"telemetry link. You can complete these tests without plugging in your LiPo "
"battery but if you do connect a battery you should first remove the "
"propellers."
msgstr ""
"您可以通过以下测试来检查失控保护，将飞控通过USB线缆或数传链路连接到 Mission Planner "
"即可进行。这些测试无需连接LiPo电池即可完成，但若已连接电池，应先拆下螺旋桨。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:113 cd09bd79077645f18567fa244a10c0bb
msgid ""
"**Test #1 : if using the \"Low-Throttle\" method, ensure the throttle "
"channel drops with loss of radio contact**"
msgstr "**测试#1：如果使用\"低油门\"方式，确认无线电信号丢失时油门通道下降**"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:116 402dd01c6bff4387ac291dd789093078
msgid ""
"Ensure your RC transmitter is on and connected with the throttle all the way"
" down and flight mode set to Stabilize"
msgstr "确认RC遥控器已开启并连接，油门全部拉低，飞行模式设置为Stabilize"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:118 22892a8e0dd349bc888e8ff2a79e8240
msgid ""
"The throttle (channel 3) PWM value should be approximately as in first "
"illustration below.  Its value may be higher or lower but it should "
"definitely be at least 10 higher than the value held in the FS PWM field"
msgstr "油门通道（通道3）的PWM值应约如下方第一个图示所示。其值可高可低，但必须至少比FS PWM字段中的值高10"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:122 3546d7901031499d84a8cd5b6f8ae35b
msgid ""
"Turn the transmitter off and the throttle PWM value should drop to be at "
"least 10 below the FS PWM field value (as in the second illustration below) "
"below"
msgstr "关闭遥控器，油门PWM值应下降至至少比FS PWM字段值低10（如下方第二个图示所示）"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:129 ecdd4fdffb4e47189413176ed0f8b9a9
msgid ""
"Test #2 : ensuring motors disarm if in STABILIZE or ACRO with throttle at "
"zero"
msgstr "测试#2：确认在Stabilize或Acro模式下油门为零时电机上锁"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:132 e600c1011fe84d15979ab60861b9f1a4
msgid ""
"Switch to stabilize mode, arm your motors but keep your throttle at zero. "
"Turn off your transmitter. The motors should disarm immediately (red led "
"will start flashing, DISARMED will be displayed in the Mission Planner's "
"Flight Data screen)."
msgstr ""
"切换到Stabilize模式，解锁电机但保持油门为零。关闭遥控器。电机应立即上锁（红灯开始闪烁，Mission Planner "
"飞行数据界面显示DISARMED）。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:137 a49cfcf0738442c3b7d8f2db9c08cc22
msgid ""
"Test #3 : ensuring flight mode changes to RTL or LAND when throttle is above"
" zero"
msgstr "测试#3：确认油门大于零时飞行模式切换到RTL或Land"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:140 8a9685b1127a4c8ba60c334467420bde
msgid ""
"Switch to stabilize mode, arm your motors and raise your throttle to the mid"
" point. Turn off your transmitter. The Flight Mode should switch to RTL if "
"you have a GPS lock or LAND if you do not have a GPS lock (the flight mode "
"and GPS lock status are visible in the Mission Planner's flight data "
"screen)."
msgstr ""
"切换到Stabilize模式，解锁电机并将油门推至中间位置。关闭遥控器。如果已获得GPS锁定，飞行模式应切换到RTL；如果未获得GPS锁定，则切换到Land模式（飞行模式和GPS锁定状态可在"
" Mission Planner 飞行数据界面中查看）。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:146 08d90764178b406488c4289772ec73d3
msgid "Test #4 : retaking control after the failsafe has cleared"
msgstr "测试#4：失控保护解除后重新取得控制权"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:148 4e67af1b0e6846e186ccddb3df5260bc
msgid "continuing on from test #3, turn your transmitter back on"
msgstr "继续测试#3，重新打开遥控器"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:149 850dfe19468e42bf9872e11fc01558f8
msgid ""
"while the flight mode is still in RTL or LAND and armed, change the flight "
"mode switch to another position and then back to stabilize mode.  Ensure "
"that the flight mode displayed on the Failsafe page is updating "
"appropriately."
msgstr ""
"在飞行模式仍为RTL或Land且已解锁的情况下，将飞行模式开关拨到另一个位置，然后再拨回Stabilize模式。确认Failsafe页面上显示的飞行模式能够正确更新。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:154 1337cd9ca4ec48da9232e3091543a5e8
msgid "Test #5 (optional) : removing power from the receiver"
msgstr "测试#5（可选）：切断接收机电源"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:156 752be6c69c104815a7ec85deaee80cc5
msgid ""
"Switch to stabilize mode, arm your motors and keep your throttle above zero."
msgstr "切换到Stabilize模式，解锁电机并保持油门大于零。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:158 941adca1d53f4ae3a76661f958c966bb
msgid ""
"Carefully disconnect the power wires connecting the receiver to the "
"autopilot"
msgstr "小心断开接收机与飞控之间的电源线"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:160 08ad040d95b24e8b83f092c97c68c8d8
msgid "The Flight Mode should switch to RTL or LAND as described in Test #3"
msgstr "飞行模式应如测试#3中所述切换到RTL或Land"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:162 4965e967f3a84a65b541830e609e382f
msgid ""
"Unplug the autopilot so that it is powered down before reattaching the "
"receiver's power"
msgstr "在重新连接接收机电源之前，先拔掉飞控电源使其断电"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:166 aa0bb8d2bc784840a10e2e8459c7830c
msgid "Using the receiver to set the flight mode (**DO NOT USE!**)"
msgstr "使用接收机设置飞行模式（**请勿使用！**）"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:168 9dbc679a6d764751ac4fc7b62fdc9be1
msgid ""
"Instead of setting up the receiver and autopilot as described above (i.e. "
"\"Low-Throttle\" and \"No Signal\" methods) the receiver can be set-up to "
"set channel 5 (flight mode channel) to a :ref:`flight mode <flight-modes>` "
"slot that has been set to RTL.  For example the receiver could be setup to "
"move ch5's pwm value to 1700us which is \"Flight Mode 5\" which could then "
"be set to RTL on the Mission Planner's Initial Setup >> Mandatory Hardware "
">> Flight Modes screen."
msgstr ""
"除上述方式（即\"低油门\"和\"无信号\"方式）外，还可以将接收机设置为在失联时将通道5（飞行模式通道）调整到已设置为RTL的 :ref:`飞行模式 "
"<flight-modes>` 档位。例如，接收机可设置为将ch5的PWM值移动到1700us，对应\"飞行模式5\"，然后在 Mission "
"Planner 的Initial Setup >> Mandatory Hardware >> Flight Modes界面将其设置为RTL。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:176 08ed0f2853744a5ea28707c03e5963c0
msgid ""
"Although this appears to work it is strongly not recommended because it can "
"result in situations that can lead to a crash. Since the autopilot has no "
"way of knowing that an RC failsafe has occurred, undesired behavior can "
"occur such as overriding other failsafes like low battery or GCS failsafes "
"with mode changes."
msgstr ""
"虽然这看似有效，但强烈不建议使用，因为这可能导致某些情况引发坠机。由于飞控无法得知已发生RC失控保护，可能出现不期望的行为，例如用模式切换覆盖其他失控保护（如低电量或地面站失控保护）。"
